+# Requirements: fixed manager raw checkout
+
+## 功能概述
+The actual40c4 Windows run37921157624/attempt1 stops at original raw manager verification before SUTrestore/compiler. Allseven actualsource hashes and GitIDs exactly match expectedLFtoCRLF; configuration origin remainsUNKNOWN. Preserve committed raw bytes with fixed path checkout attributes.
+
+## 需求列表
+### FR-1 Seven literal manager attributes
+WHEN Git checks out the management repository, exactly the existing seven public manager lease paths SHALL have versioned `-text` rules. No wildcard, broad subtree, SUT-source change, worktree rewriting, renormalization, shared/global Git configuration or runtime replacement SHALL be introduced.
+### FR-2 Strict original raw admission
+WHEN attributes preserve a manager checkout, actualbytes SHALL equal native Git HEAD blobs and the unchanged original verify_manager SHALL admit those seven raw sources. WHEN a source is deliberately mutated, the original raw verifier SHALL reject; no newline normalization or metadata comparison SHALL authorize it.
+### FR-3 Necessary real owned Git controls
+WHEN validating this fix, real owned native Git clone with command-scoped autocrlf=true SHALL first reproduce original raw-contract FAIL without attributes, then preserve allseven blobs with attributes. autocrlf=false SHALL also preserve them; an unmatched ordinary text path SHALL still convert under true to prove no broad policy. No Run-SourceCompile, WindowsnativeVM, owner, compiler, IOclose or publisher SHALL run in these controls.
+### FR-4 Immutable source and native boundary
+WHEN committing, all1862 existing paths including complete originalguard/AST, manifest, workflow, manager7, runtimeguards/settings, pins, permissions and45minute budget SHALL remain unchanged. Original SUTrestore command-scoped autocrlf=false/localfalse/customindex checkout remains exact; real Windowsrestore/compiler results remain futureCI evidence. Fresh source-specific impact UNKNOWN/manualHIGH, independent peer, stageddetect/gencommit and source-only backup precede root-only forwardpush.
+
+## 非功能需求
+Backup only inert source, singleparentpatch and safe mode/hash metadata; no private logs/runtime/env/host/TLS/credentials/objectlibrary. Originalfailedruns remain immutable.
+
+## 验收标准
+- FR-1 exact seven literal -text rules and no wildcard verified.
+- FR-2 original raw verifier admits untouched checkout and rejects mutation.
+- FR-3 actual owned nativeGit failurefirst plus positive/negative/counterexample controls execute.
+- FR-4 baseline identity, source-specific graph limits, peer and smallsoleparent40c4 commit recorded; nativequalification not inferred.
+
+## 依赖关系
+Native Git checkout attributes, original fixed seven-source raw manager verifier and disposable compiler carrier. Existing original SUTrestore falseEOL/customindex methods remain unchanged; actual WindowsCI is still required.
